x749 puts x747 x748
x750 call close x749 
x751 write x750 2
x752 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x753 puts x751 x752
x754 call open x753 6
x755 write x754 4
x756 write x755 2
