x761 puts x759 x760
x762 call close x761 
x763 write x762 2
x764 text "e0\nhi lt p2 a\nr select hi p2 a"
x765 puts x763 x764
x766 call close x765 
x767 call close x766 
x768 call close x767 
x769 call open x768 13
x770 write x769 4
x771 write x770 1
x772 text "diagnostics"
x773 puts x771 x772
x774 call open x773 11
x775 write x774 2
x776 text "Diagnostics"
x777 puts x775 x776
x778 call close x777 
x779 call open x778 2
x780 write x779 2
x781 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x782 puts x780 x781
x783 call close x782 
x784 call close x783 
ret x784
end

