x840 text "Native output exports C-ABI symbols named a0_NAME. JavaScript output is an ES module. Java output is an ordinary class. C#, Metal, and wasm32 are produced by the verification tools (bun run dotnet, gpu, verify). Every target is verified against the same oracle."
